で、無理なく描いて頂ける範囲で構いません。\n　・黒色のサキュバス衣装差分\n　・白色のサキュバス衣装差分\n　・どや顔、得意げな顔の表情\n\n・背景は透過など、簡単な物で構いません。\n\n\n前回と似た内容の依頼となってしまいますが、ご検討頂けましたら幸いです。\nよろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shinsat3/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 575213, "client_id": 3166, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f24543adeeb24b6defba835eca30a217", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f24543adeeb24b6defba835eca30a217, https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c74fea2ebcc11ec15745f9f204f6a35c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e75141819357123b95cea1ba6235ccf 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f14c1c79541491aa4f9f28567a08b071", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f14c1c79541491aa4f9f28567a08b071, https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origins/59ac3bef-ee24-4ca9-9088-26ed6ef114b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f9b12227f86c65724e16529947085a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0564657f/uploads/origin